# Local-only, git-ignored file for the debug-build "Test connection"
# shortcut on the Dock screen (see DockScreen.kt / build.gradle.kts).
#
# Copy this file to dev.secrets.properties (same directory) and fill in
# real values from a device you've already paired via the normal flow
# (admin/cm_companion_pairing.php -> Generate pairing code -> pair once
# in-app or via a manual exchange call). This is NOT a shortcut around
# pairing itself - it just lets a debug build skip re-typing the same
# values every rebuild, e.g. when sharing a debug APK with family/testers
# who don't need to see or manage the admin panel.
#
# NEVER commit dev.secrets.properties (with real values) - it's a live
# Bridge device token, equivalent to a password for whatever scopes that
# device was granted. dev.secrets.properties is gitignored; this .example
# file (no real values) is the only one meant to be committed.

DEV_BRIDGE_URL=
DEV_INSTALLATION_ID=
DEV_DEVICE_TOKEN=
DEV_DEVICE_LABEL=
